  "bodyHash": "+5YFj7W4vN8=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個由Serilum製作的模組，用心締造。為Fabric、Forge和Neo打造了許多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於這個模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Stack Refill 是一個實用模組，會在玩家手中物品堆疊用完時，自動從背包中尋找相同物品並補充。它適用於戰鬥中的武器、挖掘方塊的工具、放置方塊時的堆疊、進食、使用藥水、將物品丟到地上、飲用牛奶桶、釣竿斷裂時，也應該能與所有模組方塊相容。這是我個人最喜愛的生活品質改進之一。<br><br>為了最佳穩定性，<strong>客戶端</strong>和<strong>伺服器端</strong>都需要安裝。僅在伺服器端安裝也能使用，但可能會造成一些視覺上的不同步。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於「原生體驗」整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的生活品質套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>戰鬥中替換劍的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>挖掘泥土時替換鏟子的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>放置原木方塊時替換堆疊的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"586\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>食用麵包後自動補滿的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飲用藥水後自動補滿的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>丟棄物品後自動補滿的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"608\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飲用牛奶桶後自動補滿的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/g.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>釣竿最後一次使用後自動更換的過程：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/h.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在（模組）方塊上使用物品時，例如 Ex Nihilo 的篩網：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/i.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上逐一追蹤。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
